<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming said on Friday it had downgraded Telefonica de Argentina SA to hold from long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Analysts William Laurent and Ronald Aitken wrote in a report that under a tariff rebalancing program Telefonica's &quot;former advantage, which was to operate in most of Buenos Aires, where local tariffs will go up, will ... be eliminated.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were up 1-1/8 to 30-1/4 in New York trade on Friday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
